This is the source code for CDC-X client UI.

It is a Qt6 desktop app. 

It can be run on Windows (10+), MacOS (15+, but may work on older Macs too), and Linux 22.04+

As distributed by Dwyco, building requires:

CMake

Windows: MSVC2022, Qt6.8+ 64-bit

Mac: Xcode 16, Qt6.8+

Linux: Ubuntu 22.04, and Qt6.8+

